@startuml inputPipeline
title Sequence: Input Pipeline (Python → UDP → Provider → FaceInputManager)

actor UnityEngine as Unity

Unity -> PythonProcessService: StartPython(exe, script)
PythonProcessService -> Python: Launch Mediapipe_sender.py

== Python sends data ==

loop Every frame (Python)
    Python -> UdpReceiverService: Send JSON (landmarks + blendshapes)
end

== Unity receives data ==

UdpReceiverService -> UdpReceiverService: ReceiveLoop()
UdpReceiverService -> FaceData: Parse JSON
UdpReceiverService -> MediaPipeProvider: Update LatestLandmarks / LatestBlendshapes
UdpReceiverService -> MediaPipeProvider: PythonReady = true

== Provider updates ==

Unity -> MediaPipeProvider: Update()
MediaPipeProvider -> GameStateManager: SetState(ProfileSelection) (first time only)

== FaceInputManager processes input ==

Unity -> FaceInputManager: Update()

alt Blink detection ready
    FaceInputManager -> EARCalculator: ComputeBothEyes(landmarks)
    EARCalculator --> FaceInputManager: EAR value

    FaceInputManager -> BlinkDetector: UpdateEAR(EAR)
    BlinkDetector --> FaceInputManager: BlinkStarted / BlinkEnded
end

alt Emotion detection ready
    FaceInputManager -> BlendshapeNormalizer: NormalizeBlendshapes(raw)
    BlendshapeNormalizer --> FaceInputManager: normalized blendshapes

    FaceInputManager -> EmotionFeatureCalculator: CalculateEmotionFeatures()
    EmotionFeatureCalculator --> FaceInputManager: emotionScores

    FaceInputManager -> EmotionDetector: ClassifyEmotion(scores)
    EmotionDetector --> FaceInputManager: currentEmotion
end

== UI / Conditions react ==

FaceInputManager -> LiveFaceUI: UpdateEmotion()
FaceInputManager -> LiveFaceUI: UpdateBlinkCount()

FaceInputManager -> EmotionHoldCondition: currentEmotion (queried during Hold phase)

@enduml
